    "sections": {
        "description": "VW Modern Ecommerce Theme is designed with a clean layout suitable for creating an online store with a structured product display. It includes organized homepage sections, category blocks, featured product areas, banners, and navigation options that help present products clearly. The layout is responsive, allowing pages to adapt across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. It also supports customization through built-in settings for colors, fonts, and page sections without requiring extensive code changes. The theme is compatible with common ecommerce functionality, making product listings, shopping carts, and checkout integration straightforward. Performance-focused coding practices help maintain usability, while the overall structure keeps content easy to manage. Additional sections for testimonials, featured collections, promotional banners, and contact details allow information to be displayed in an organized format. The theme follows standard coding practices and provides a practical foundation for building an ecommerce website with a simple and consistent design."
    },
